<title>USA: Compass says extends offer for DAKA Intl.</title>
<headline>Compass says extends offer for DAKA Intl.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compass Group Plc said on Wednesday that its Compass Holdings Inc unit was extending its offer to purchase all outstanding shares of common stock of DAKA International Inc for $7.50 per share in cash until midnight EDT (0400 GMT) July 14.</p>
<p>The terms of the extended offer are identical to the terms of the original offer announced on May 29, a news release issued by Compass said.</p>
</text>
